WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.150
If you learn something because you have to, that's school.

2
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:08.375
If you learn it because it pays, that's work.

3
00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:13.725
If you learn it because someone is watching, that's performance.

4
00:00:14.675 --> 00:00:23.250
But if you learn something at two in the morning, with nobody to tell and no reason you could explain, that's curiosity.

5
00:00:24.225 --> 00:00:26.925
School ends when the exam ends.

6
00:00:27.925 --> 00:00:30.300
Work ends when the pay stops.

7
00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:34.275
Performance ends when the room empties.

8
00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:40.200
Curiosity has no reason to end, because nothing started it.

9
00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.125
You just wanted to know.
